; kata-deploy 4.2.0 policy-revision 1 grants create/write but not
; append on CRI config files. The CRI-O drop-in writer opens
; 99-kata-deploy with O_APPEND, so without this rule kata-deploy fails
; with "Permission denied (os error 13)" (AVC denied { append }
; kata_deploy_t -> container_config_t).
;
; The types come from the chart's kata-deploy module. The optional
; block disables the rule instead of failing the whole policy build
; when they are gone (chart module removed, or renamed in an upgrade).
(optional kata_deploy_crio_append
  (allow kata_deploy_cri_config_writer kata_deploy_cri_config_target (file (append))))
